# SHELL BLAST: a cannon shell's impact (cannonShell.pre ImpactPuff; GameProjectileComponent::destroy emits a few puffs
# through ParticleSystem::emitPuff, on every role, with shell_flash.pfx): pale-cyan light shards thrown out low over the
# ground (the splash: ~4 m). A puff plays the FIRST emitter only. `Rate` 0 and `Burst` = the puff's particle count.
# Colors are linear HDR (rgb * intensity); the scene tonemaps, so bright additive values glow.
ParticleEffect ShellBlast
	Emitter Shards
		Texture Textures/Particles/spark.dds
		Rate 0
		Burst 36
		SpawnRadius 0.4
		Offset 0, 0.3, 0
		ConeAngle 170
		Speed 5.0 11.0
		Life 0.3 0.8
		Gravity 8.0
		Drag 2.0
		Turbulence 1.5 1.0 0.5
		Size 0.4 0.08
		SizeVariance 0.5
		VelocityStretch 0.05
		ColorStart 10.0, 26.0, 36.0, 1
		ColorEnd 1.5, 5.0, 8.0, 0
		Additivity 1
		FadeIn 0.01
		FadeOutStart 0.35
		SoftFade 0.1
